    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4062" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλέω</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>: impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤλουν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					10.1
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤλεσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					183
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fist.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Steril.</u>
				230
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				Ep.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλεσσα </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				20.109
			</span></i>: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλήλεκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.251
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Nicarch.
			</span></i>):—
				Pass.
			, pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλήλεσμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.76
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλήλεμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.26
				</span></i>
			, Amph.<i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i>: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠλέσθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.120
				</span></i>
			:—<i>grind, bruise</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in compd. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-αλέω</span>, q.
			v.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤλουν τὰ σιτία</span> Pherecr.l.c.;
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος ἀληλεμένος</span>
			<i>civilized</i> life, in which one uses <i>ground</i> corn and
			not law fruits, Amph. l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλει, μύλα,
				ἄλει</span>
			<i>grind</i>, mill, <i>grind ! Carm. Pop.</i><i><span class="en">
				43
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψὲ θεῶν ἀλέουσι
				μύλαι, ἀλέουσι δὲ λεπτά</span> Poet. ap. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				1.287
			</span></i>.</div>
